1. System Architecture Diagram (using Mermaid.js) showing flow:
   - Employee → Mobile App (PWA/React Native) → Fingerprint Scan → Cloud Backend → Log Stored → Payroll Calculated
2. Firestore/DB Schema (collection names, fields, relationships)
3. Frontend Code Snippets (React Native or PWA HTML/JS) for:
   - Biometric authentication flow
   - Clock-in/out UI
   - Attendance history display
4. Backend Logic (Cloud Functions or Node.js route) for:
   - Validating fingerprint match
   - Logging timestamps
   - Calculating daily overtime and monthly payroll
5. Admin Dashboard Concept (screenshots or mockup description)
6. Step-by-Step Deployment Guide (how to set up Firebase/Firestore, connect scanner, deploy app)
7. Payroll Calculation Formula in code or pseudocode

